y\"<|>\"燃煤发电企业\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Coal-fired power generation enterprises are involved in the annual base electricity contract signing process, where yearly purchase and sale contracts are established between power plants and grids, specifying annual volume, monthly plans, and pricing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度双边直接交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An annual bilateral direct transaction refers to a type of electricity trading conducted between parties on an annual basis, involving direct agreements without centralized bidding, and is automatically contracted after confirmation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度双边跨省跨区交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An annual bilateral cross-provincial and inter-regional transaction involves agreements between entities from different provinces or regions, which must pass safety checks and are generated automatically post-confirmation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度双边合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"An annual bilateral contract electricity transfer transaction refers to the transfer of contracted electricity volumes between market participants, processed through the technical support system and subject to safety verification.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度集中竞价交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Annual concentrated bidding transaction is a market mechanism held annually to conduct provincial direct trades, inter-provincial and inter-regional trades, and contract transfers, lasting no more than two working days per category.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度双边交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Monthly bilateral transaction refers to a monthly market activity enabling provincial direct trades, inter-provincial and inter-regional trades, and contract transfers, with a duration not exceeding three working days.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度集中竞价交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Monthly concentrated bidding transaction is a market mechanism conducted monthly for provincial direct trades, inter-provincial and inter-regional trades, and contract transfers, each lasting no more than two working days.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"跨省跨区临时